description:
This book provides a multi-perspective approach to sustainability and value chains to allow understanding from a variety of disciplines and professional backgrounds. Some of the key features of this book include:

Short vignettes of important trends along with relevant management issues;
Evidence-based management examples from leading multinational companies, as well as small and medium enterprises spanning supply chains;
References to appropriate tools, emerging technology, and practices;
Chapter action items for the reader to take a deeper look at integration opportunities involving sustainability and supply chain management;
An action-learning approach to applying concepts and tools so readers from any functional perspective can implement and manage sustainability projects;
and guidelines on how to move forward with your supply chain sustainability initiative.

translatedDescription:
Este libro proporciona un enfoque multi-perspectivo a las cadenas de sostenibilidad y valor para permitir la comprensión de una variedad de disciplinas y antecedentes profesionales. Algunas de las características clave de este libro incluyen:

Vignettes cortas de tendencias importantes junto con cuestiones de gestión pertinentes;
Ejemplos de gestión basados en pruebas de las principales empresas multinacionales, así como pequeñas y medianas empresas que abarcan cadenas de suministro;
Referencias a instrumentos apropiados, tecnología emergente y prácticas;
Temas de acción del capítulo para que el lector examine más a fondo las oportunidades de integración que implican la sostenibilidad y la gestión de la cadena de suministro;
Un enfoque orientado a la acción para aplicar conceptos e instrumentos para que los lectores de cualquier perspectiva funcional puedan implementar y gestionar proyectos de sostenibilidad;
y directrices sobre cómo avanzar con su iniciativa de sostenibilidad de la cadena de suministro.

description:
Windows XP Unleashed guides the advanced reader through nearly every Windows XP topic imaginable giving ideas and solutions practical to typical problems encountered by professionals. Examples of topics covered are:

Installations, use, and maintenance;

Performance tuning;

Optimizing memory;

Detailed registry info;

Pushing hardware profiles to their limits;

XP system tools;

How to build network bridges between Dissimilar operating systems;

Working with compatibility modes to enable older O/S to interact with XP;

Device driver rollback;

Automatic driver update;

Ensuring perfect printing always;

Maximizing XP for the internet, intranet, and security.

